<title>FINLAND: Silja 1996 loss narrows to FIM 133 mln.</title>
<headline>Silja 1996 loss narrows to FIM 133 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items		     133 vs 389 loss</p>
<p> Gross invoicing (billion)			4.0 vs 3.8</p>
<p> Operating profit				   110 vs 88 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast for Finnish passenger ferry operator Silja Oy Ab was for a 150 million markka loss.  </p>
<p> Non-recurring items			charge 84 vs 89 charge</p>
<p> Interest-bearing liabilities (billion)     3.7 vs 4.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Finnish passenger ferry operator is Silja Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
